Lucide icons
------------

The SVG icon paths in R/icons.R and the icon markup in inst/assets (the
component anatomy, scripts and stylesheets, including the spinner) are
taken from Lucide, https://lucide.dev. Some of those icons are derived from
Feather, https://feathericons.com.

