shadcn/ui design tokens
-----------------------

The colour token values in inst/assets/tokens (the default theme and the
theme presets) follow those published by shadcn/ui, https://ui.shadcn.com.
No shadcn/ui source code is included: the CSS and JavaScript in this
package were written for it.

